		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Mist Cloak</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Become invisible in a shroud of mist.</em></p><p><strong>1 Action.</strong> You become Invisible for 1 minute or until you attack or use an ability.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> You are Hidden as if succeeding a Stealth (DEX) check.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> You are Invisible while in smoke, mist, fog or other gases.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Give yourself Invisible and treat yourself as Hidden.</em></p>",
